§§ `s 16 -- notice of a change`

`I moved out and let my home` MEANS `Change in use` WITH
    `the land ceased to be principal residence land, primary production land or exempt land` IS TRUE
    `a factor relevant to whether, or how far, it is principal residence, primary production or exempt land altered` IS TRUE
    `the land ceased to be, or became, land to be apportioned under s 19A, 19B, 19C or 30A` IS FALSE

`I lost my pensioner card` MEANS `Change in use` WITH
    `the land ceased to be principal residence land, primary production land or exempt land` IS TRUE
    `a factor relevant to whether, or how far, it is principal residence, primary production or exempt land altered` IS FALSE
    `the land ceased to be, or became, land to be apportioned under s 19A, 19B, 19C or 30A` IS FALSE

`nothing changed` MEANS `Change in use` WITH
    `the land ceased to be principal residence land, primary production land or exempt land` IS FALSE
    `a factor relevant to whether, or how far, it is principal residence, primary production or exempt land altered` IS FALSE
    `the land ceased to be, or became, land to be apportioned under s 19A, 19B, 19C or 30A` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the owner must notify under s 16` `I moved out and let my home`
#ASSERT `the owner must notify under s 16` `I lost my pensioner card`
#ASSERT NOT (`the owner must notify under s 16` `nothing changed`)
#ASSERT `the days to notify under s 16` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `the most penalty units for an offence against s 16` EQUALS 10

§§ `Regulative rules`

-- s 10(2): notice on day 0, due on day 30.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 10(2) -- the owner must pay the land tax by the day it is due` 30) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `pay the land tax` 30)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the owner, "s 10(2): land tax is due ..." (paid on day 31)
#TRACE `s 10(2) -- the owner must pay the land tax by the day it is due` 30 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the owner` DOES `pay the land tax` AT 31

-- s 13: instalment due day 30; missed; the Commissioner requires the full amount within 14 days; paid on day 40.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 13 -- the owner must pay each instalment, or may be required to pay the full year's tax` 30 TRUE 14) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `pay the instalment` 20)) EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 13 -- the owner must pay each instalment, or may be required to pay the full year's tax` 30 TRUE 14) 0 (LIST (WAITUNTIL 31), (EVENT `the owner` `pay the full amount of the land tax for the year` 40)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the owner, "s 13(2): after a missed instalment the full amount ..." (full amount paid on day 50, after 31 + 14 = 45)
#TRACE `s 13 -- the owner must pay each instalment, or may be required to pay the full year's tax` 30 TRUE 14 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 31)
    PARTY `the owner` DOES `pay the full amount of the land tax for the year` AT 50
-- expect: BREACH BY the owner, "s 13(2): an instalment was not paid by its due date" (no requirement for the full amount)
#TRACE `s 13 -- the owner must pay each instalment, or may be required to pay the full year's tax` 30 FALSE 14 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 31)

-- s 16: change on day 0; notice on day 30 is in time.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 16 -- the owner must notify the Commissioner of a change within 30 days` `I moved out and let my home`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `notify the Commissioner in writing of the change` 30)) EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 16 -- the owner must notify the Commissioner of a change within 30 days` `nothing changed`) 0 (LIST (WAITUNTIL 60)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the owner, "s 16: an owner must notify the Commissioner in writing within 30 days ..." (notice on day 31)
#TRACE `s 16 -- the owner must notify the Commissioner of a change within 30 days` `I lost my pensioner card` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the owner` DOES `notify the Commissioner in writing of the change` AT 31

-- s 37: apply, and the Commissioner grants.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 37 -- the owner may apply, and the Commissioner is to grant a rebate equal to the land tax paid` `built and moved in during the year`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `apply for the s 37 rebate` 10), (EVENT `the Commissioner` `grant a rebate equal to the land tax paid` 40)) EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 37 -- the owner may apply, and the Commissioner is to grant a rebate equal to the land tax paid` `built and moved from my old home, sold in the same year`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `apply for the s 37 rebate` 10)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: the Commissioner's obligation to grant a rebate equal to the land tax paid, still pending (applied on day 10, nothing granted yet)
#TRACE `s 37 -- the owner may apply, and the Commissioner is to grant a rebate equal to the land tax paid` `built and moved in during the year` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the owner` DOES `apply for the s 37 rebate` AT 10

-- s 37A: possession on 20 October 2026 (day 0); the last day to apply, 30 September 2027, is day 345.
#ASSERT `days from` (YMD 2026 10 20) `to` (`the last day to apply for a s 37A rebate` 2026) EQUALS 345
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 37A -- the owner may apply by 30 September after the year, and the Commissioner is to grant the rebate` `the move in 2026` 345) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `apply for the s 37A rebate` 345), (EVENT `the Commissioner` `grant a rebate of the land tax paid on the other land` 360)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- Applying on day 346 is too late: the right lapses and nothing is owed to the owner.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 37A -- the owner may apply by 30 September after the year, and the Commissioner is to grant the rebate` `the move in 2026` 345) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `apply for the s 37A rebate` 346)) EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 37A -- the owner may apply by 30 September after the year, and the Commissioner is to grant the rebate` `the move with the old home let` 345) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the owner` `apply for the s 37A rebate` 10)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: the Commissioner's obligation to grant a rebate of the land tax paid on the other land, still pending (applied in time on day 100)
#TRACE `s 37A -- the owner may apply by 30 September after the year, and the Commissioner is to grant the rebate` `the move in 2026` 345 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the owner` DOES `apply for the s 37A rebate` AT 100
